        <h2>In Our Community</h2>
        <p>For nearly 30 years, Bethlehem has been a founding partner of the <strong>Common Cup Ministry</strong>, a coalition of churches serving McLeod County. Through Common Cup, our congregation hosts the annual <strong>Fall Coat Giveaway</strong>, prepares and serves meals, and provides school supplies, personal care items, and emergency shelter support to neighbors in need.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px;">We also maintain a long-standing partnership with the <strong>McLeod County Food Shelf</strong>, delivering donations twice a month and contributing financially &mdash; including a $10,000 gift in 2025 &mdash; to help meet growing need across the county.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="img-col">
        <img src="/images/coat-drive-sorting-by-size-0a16cecab6.jpg" alt="Coat drive sorting by size">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band-cream">
