      <div class="img-col">
        <img src="/images/food-for-kidz-volunteers-packing-meals-775c8e4ca2.jpg" alt="Food for Kidz volunteers packing meals">
      </div>
      <div class="text-col">
        <h2>Food for Kidz</h2>
        <p>For 12 years running, Bethlehem has funded and hosted a Food for Kidz meal-packing event &mdash; bringing together nearly 140 volunteers, from senior citizens to the local high school football team, to pack meals for food shelves here and around the world.</p>
        <div class="stat">Nearly 40,000 meals packed in 2025.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band-light">
    <div class="two-col">
      <div class="text-col">
        <h2>Trunk or Treat</h2>
        <p>Each fall, Bethlehem opens its doors &mdash; and its trunks &mdash; for a community-wide Trunk or Treat, now a 12-year tradition. It's become a favorite not just for our congregation but for neighbors across Hutchinson, many of whom volunteer their own vehicles and time.</p>
        <div class="stat">More than 400 children attend each year.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="img-col">
        <img src="/images/trunk-or-treat-9f7020deb8.jpg" alt="Trunk or Treat">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band-cream">
    <div class="two-col reverse">
      <div class="img-col">
        <img src="/images/dignity-kit-packing-b6558908ce.jpg" alt="Dignity Kit packing">
      </div>
      <div class="text-col">
        <h2>Midwest Mission Collection Site</h2>
        <p>Bethlehem serves as a regional collection site for Midwest Mission, supporting projects like Dignity Kits and school supply drives for children in need around the world.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px; font-size:14px;">If you're looking to donate items through Midwest Mission, please start at <a class="link-out" href="https://www.midwestmission.org/collection-sites" target="_blank">midwestmission.org</a> &mdash; they can answer questions about what's needed and connect you with drop-off details.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band-light" style="text-align:center;">
